        ],
        "summary": "列举私有hook",
        "description": "列举私有hook(ListPrivateHooks)\n\n列举当前局点下用户所有的私有hook。\n\n  * 可以使用sort_key和sort_dir两个关键字对返回结果按创建时间(create_time)进行排序。给予的sort_key和sort_dir的数量须一致,否则返回400。若未给予sort_key和sort_dir,则默认按照创建时间降序排序。\n  * 若当前用户没有任何私有hook,则返回空list。\n  * 具体返回的信息见ListPrivateHooksResponseBody。\n  * 支持分页返回。如果响应中存在next_marker,则表示实际总输出比当前响应中包含的输出多。在对请求的后续调用中,在请求参数中使用此值,以获取输出的下一部分。您应该重复此操作,直到next_marker响应元素返回为null",
        "operationId": "ListPrivateHooks",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "Client-Request-Id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "用户指定的,对于此请求的唯一Id,用于定位某个请求,推荐使用UUID",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 128,
            "minLength": 36,
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9]+[A-Za-z0-9-]*$"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_key",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "排序字段,仅支持给予create_time",
            "required": false,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "enum": [
                "create_time"
              ]
            },
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "sort_dir",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "指定升序还是降序\n  * `asc` - 升序\n  * `desc` - 降序",
            "required": false,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1,
              "enum": [
                "asc",
                "desc"
              ]
            },
            "collectionFormat": "multi"
          },
          {
            "name": "marker",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "分页标记。当一页无法返回所有结果,上一次的请求将返回next_marker以指引还有更多页数,用户可以将next_marker中的值放到此处以查询下一页的信息。此marker只能用于与上一请求指定的相同参数的请求。不指定时默认从第一页开始查询。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 512,
            "minLength": 1
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "每页返回的最多结果数量",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 1000,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "minimum": 10
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "列举私有hook成功",
            "examples": {
              "x-response-examples-1": {
                "page_info": {
                  "current_count": 2,
                  "previous_marker": "zxc1oHc08HcCmypYGTsOoRcvoHUvHRUAW5NOSnc1oHc08HcCPZrwP5NOeTlRiukJgtGxeujJeuGwGIihaIUCmypYGTsOtqvKPr2xmH8fPqpGWyQ0axGwGZp9aqvx8pQ7m5FvGTsJiKk7gtNFiuaxetdRCks="
